  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"plainlinks ombox ombox-notice\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.0em;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"mbox-image\">\n  <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/1/15/Edit-copy_green.svg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20150808172902\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Edit-copy green.svg\" data-image-key=\"Edit-copy_green.svg\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"mbox-text\" style=\"\"> <b>This is a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Template_documentation\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Template documentation\">documentation</a> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Subpages\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Subpages\">subpage</a> for <a href=\"/wiki/Template:WikiProject_Infoboxes_sidebar\" title=\"Template:WikiProject Infoboxes sidebar\">Template:WikiProject Infoboxes sidebar</a></b>.<br />It contains usage information, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Categorization\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Categorization\">categories</a> and other content that is not part of the original template page. </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table> <table class=\"vertical-navbox nowraplinks plainlist collapsible\" style=\"float:right;clear:right;width:22.0em;margin:0 0 1.0em 1.0em;background:#f9f9f9;border:1px solid #aaa;padding:0.2em;border-spacing:0.4em 0;text-align:center;line-height:1.4em;font-size:88%;width:auto;background:#f5faff;font-size:90%;line-height:1.6em;\"><tbody><tr><th style=\"background:#cee0f2;;padding:0.2em 0.4em 0.2em;font-size:145%;line-height:1.2em;font-size:130%;padding-left:0.4em;padding-right:0.4em; display:block;margin-bottom:6px; font-size:100%;padding:0.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size:130%;\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/WikiProject_Infoboxes\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:WikiProject Infoboxes\">WikiProject Infoboxes</a></span></th></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 0.1em 0.4em;padding-top:0.15em;\">\n<span style=\"position:relative; bottom:0.25em;\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_infoboxes\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:List of infoboxes\">List of infoboxes</a></span></td>\n</tr><tr><th style=\"padding:0.1em;background:#cee0f2;;padding:0.1em 0.25em 0.15em;font-size:105%;\">\nStyle and help</th></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 0.1em 0.4em;padding-top:0.15em;\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Manual_of_Style/Infoboxes\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Manual of Style/Infoboxes\">Manual of Style/Infoboxes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/Help:Infobox\" title=\"Help:Infobox\">Help:Infobox</a></li></ul></td>\n</tr><tr><th style=\"padding:0.1em;background:#cee0f2;;padding:0.1em 0.25em 0.15em;font-size:105%;\">\nCleanup</th></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 0.1em 0.4em;padding-top:0.15em;\">\n<table class=\"vertical-navbox nowraplinks\" style=\"float:right;clear:right;width:22.0em;margin:0 0 1.0em 1.0em;background:#f9f9f9;border:1px solid #aaa;padding:0.2em;border-spacing:0.4em 0;text-align:center;line-height:1.4em;font-size:88%;&#91;&#91;:Template:Subsidebar bodystyle&#93;&#93;\"><tbody><tr><th style=\"padding:0.1em\">\nTalk page</th></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 0.1em 0.4em\">\n<ul><li><div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li>\n<li><div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li>\n<li><div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li></ul></td>\n</tr><tr><th style=\"padding:0.1em\">\nArticle</th></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 0.1em 0.4em\">\n<ul><li><div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li></ul></td>\n</tr></tbody></table></td>\n</tr><tr><th style=\"padding:0.1em;background:#cee0f2;;padding:0.1em 0.25em 0.15em;font-size:105%;\">\nBuilding</th></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 0.1em 0.4em;padding-top:0.15em;\">\n<ul><li><div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_infoboxes/Proposed\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:List of infoboxes/Proposed\">List of infoboxes/Proposed</a></li></ul></td>\n</tr><tr><th style=\"padding:0.1em;background:#cee0f2;;padding:0.1em 0.25em 0.15em;font-size:105%;\">\nTo do</th></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 0.1em 0.4em;padding-top:0.15em;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Wikipedia articles with an infobox request (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6V2lraXBlZGlhX2FydGljbGVzX3dpdGhfYW5faW5mb2JveF9yZXF1ZXN0P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Add infobox</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Pages needing an infobox conversion (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6UGFnZXNfbmVlZGluZ19hbl9pbmZvYm94X2NvbnZlcnNpb24/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Change template used</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Wikipedia infobox cleanup (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6V2lraXBlZGlhX2luZm9ib3hfY2xlYW51cD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Cleanup contents</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Templates_suitable_for_conversion_to_use_Template:Infobox\" class=\"newcategory\" title=\"Category:Templates suitable for conversion to use Template:Infobox\">Convert to use {{Infobox}}</a></li></ul></td>\n</tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:right;font-size:115%\"><div class=\"plainlinks hlist navbar mini\"><ul><li class=\"nv-view\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:WikiProject_Infoboxes_sidebar\" title=\"Template:WikiProject Infoboxes sidebar\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></a></li><li class=\"nv-talk\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Template talk:WikiProject Infoboxes sidebar (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGVtcGxhdGVfdGFsazpXaWtpUHJvamVjdF9JbmZvYm94ZXNfc2lkZWJhcj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\"><span title=\"Discuss this template\">t</span></span></li><li class=\"nv-edit\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://second-renaissance.fandom.com/wiki/Template:WikiProject_Infoboxes_sidebar?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this template\">e</span></a></li></ul></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The <b><code>{{<a href=\"/wiki/Template:WikiProject_Infoboxes_sidebar\" title=\"Template:WikiProject Infoboxes sidebar\">WikiProject Infoboxes sidebar</a>}}</code></b> template is used on pages related to the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/WikiProject_Infoboxes\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:WikiProject Infoboxes\"> WikiProject Infoboxes</a>, without <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SUBST\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wp:SUBST\">substitution</a>, allowing the automatic inclusion of future modifications.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\">Usage</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Place this sidebar template at the top of pages relevant to Infoboxes. The template is expanded by default.\n</p><p>The parameter <i><code>collapsed<code></code></code></i><code><code> may be used to collapse the sidebar listing and hide the detail. \n</code></code></p><code><code><dl><dd><code>{{WikiProject Infoboxes sidebar |collapsed}}</code></dd></dl></code></code><p><code><code>\n</code></code></p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119205519\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.079 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.113 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 518/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 18575/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3012/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 17/100\nExpensive parser function count: 1/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 50/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 698112/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   67.504      1 -total\n 70.87%   47.843      1 Template:WikiProject